<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48117" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thĕmiscȳra</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεμίσκυρα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in
			Pontus</i>, <i>on the Thermodon</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 3,
				4, § 10</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thĕmiscȳrae-us</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Themiscyra</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">luci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 22, 8, 14</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thĕmi-scȳrēnus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., the same, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 3, 3,
				§ 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">24, 17, 102, § 165</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
